  "name": "Blackhorse311 - ForcibleEntry",
  "slug": "blackhorse311-forcibleentry",
  "teaser": "Forgot your keys? No problem. Kick any locked door enough times and brute force your way in.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/rJvht33CGo3nnNGtVfLs0Z1qddcunCGEydKPKZ2W.png",
  "downloads": 6089,
  "favourites_count": 16,
  "description": "<h1>Blackhorse311-ForcibleEntry</h1>\n<p>Force open any locked door by breaching it multiple times.</p>\n<h2>How It Works</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Find a locked door in-raid</li>\n<li>Use the breach (kick) action on the door</li>\n<li>Repeat 5 times consecutively (within 10 seconds)</li>\n<li>The door is forced open!</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Features</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Any Locked Door</strong> - Works on all locked doors, not just specific ones</li>\n<li><strong>No Items Required</strong> - Uses the existing breach/kick mechanic</li>\n<li><strong>Configurable</strong> - Adjust breach count (1-20) and timeout (5-60 seconds)</li>\n<li><strong>Client-Side Only</strong> - No server mod needed</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Configuration</h2>\n<p>After first run, edit <code>BepInEx/config/com.blackhorse311.forcibleentry.cfg</code>:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Setting</th>\n<th>Default</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>BreachesToUnlock</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Breaches required to force open a door</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BreachTimeout</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>Seconds before breach counter resets</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Extract the archive to your SPT root folder</li>\n<li>Start SPT and play!</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Requirements</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>SPT 4.0.x</li>\n<li>BepInEx 5.4.x (included with SPT)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Source Code</h2>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Blackhorse311/Blackhorse311-ForcibleEntry\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/Blackhorse311/Blackhorse311-ForcibleEntry</a></p>\n",
